# Salin ke `.env` lalu sesuaikan. Di-bake saat `bun run wallet:build`
# (bukan saat runtime). Kosong/absen = wallet ikut hostname halaman:
#   http://localhost:...  → http://localhost:8000/rpc   (dev lokal, tetap jalan)
#   https://wallet...     → https://wallet.../rpc       (butuh proxy /rpc di NPM)
#
# Deploy devnet online — WAJIB diisi (halaman https tidak boleh fetch http):
# VITE_RPC_URL=https://rpc.domain.com/rpc
VITE_RPC_URL=
